    "title": "Siemens Foundation launches $9.25M training program to boost electrical talent pool - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WRAL News staff reports ,\n1 days ago The Siemens Foundation launched a training program aimed at closing a skills gap and creating opportunities for people interested in electrical careers. The foundation, an arm of German conglomerate Siemens, is investing $9.25 million in the program. The group kicked off the program Tuesday in North Carolina, where Siemens employs about 2,300 workers. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 12",
